# Asima OS self-maintenance (docs/architecture.md §12). See /usr/lib/asimaos/asimaos-maintenance.
[Unit]
Description=Asima OS: give back unused disk space (balance)
Documentation=file:///usr/lib/asimaos/asimaos-maintenance
ConditionKernelCommandLine=!asimaos.live
ConditionACPower=true
[Service]
Type=oneshot
ExecStart=/usr/lib/asimaos/asimaos-maintenance balance
Nice=19
CPUSchedulingPolicy=idle
IOSchedulingClass=idle
